TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas phase, pH 2, 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    Fe(2) 4e-3
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 1

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
        -steps 1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -totals Si
END
